meta {
  name: Items
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  # Inventory Items

  All routes require a Bearer token and the relevant `items:*` permission.

  List query parameters:

  - `search` - matches name or description
  - `category` - `flavor`, `topping`, `cone`, `cup`, `packaging`, `other`
  - `low_stock` - `true` to return items at or below their reorder level
  - `page`, `limit` - pagination (`limit` max 100)
  - `sort` - `name`, `quantity`, `price_cents`, `created_at`; prefix `-` for desc

  Run `Create Item` before the ID-based requests, or set the collection variable
  `itemId` to an existing item.
}
